{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115226","id":3197006062,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6-jnDu","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115226","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115226.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115226.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115226","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115226/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115226/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115226/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/334627d21ab8c275c5df2dcbfe18c2c6139e13d9","number":115226,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add C# Vector Swizzling from Source Generator","user":{"login":"coldays","id":9074700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNzQ3MDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9074700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coldays","html_url":"https://github.com/coldays","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coldays/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coldays/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coldays/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coldays/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coldays/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coldays/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coldays/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coldays/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coldays/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR adds a source generator to GodotSharp which generates swizzling properties for all vector structs.\r\nAll properties generated are not EditorBrowsable nor DebuggerBrowsable.\r\n~Only getters are generated, but the source generator can easily be extended to generate setters as well.~\r\n\r\nThis way of implementing this feature was already discussed in #93012 and discussed in [this proposal](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/727) and circumvents the down-side of having hardcoded properties.\r\n\r\nExample of usage:\r\n```C#\r\nVector3 vec3 = new Vector3(1, 2, 3);\r\nVector4 vec4 = vec3.ZYXZ;\r\nPrint(vec4); // [3, 2, 1, 3]\r\nVector2 vec2 = vec3.XY;\r\nPrint(vec2); // [1, 2]\r\nvec2.YX = new Vector2(5, 6);\r\nPrint(vec2); // [6, 5]\r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a